NOTE ON MAP CONTENT:
The historical map images and metadata in this archive are sourced from
publicly accessible collections of the Library of Congress, Wikimedia Commons,
the Bibliothèque nationale de France (Gallica), the Internet Archive, Natural
Earth, USGS, NASA, and other institutions. Each individual map is distributed
under the licence stated on its record page — typically public domain or a
Creative Commons licence. Where the source institution requires attribution,
it is shown on the map's detail page.

The MIT licence above covers ONLY the application code in this repository,
not the map images themselves.
